  <!-- EN: meld beast growth -->
  <FH_MeldGrowth.label>母獸成長</FH_MeldGrowth.label>
  <!-- EN: The meld beast has consumed its corresponding core and undergone permanent growth. Each growth level increases mutualism capacity, twisted flesh capacity, body part health, regeneration, bleed resistance, and damage resistance. -->
  <FH_MeldGrowth.description>母獸吞食了與自身對應的結塊，產生了永久性的成長。每級成長都會提高寄生空間、扭曲肉容量、部位生命值、再生能力、抗失血能力和傷害抗性。</FH_MeldGrowth.description>

